# ChangeLog

## 0.0.96

### Added

- SQLite-backed API token auth — replaces hardcoded `akshare`/`akfamily` credentials
- Auto-bootstrapped root token on first startup (printed to log)
- Pre-configured token file via `AKTOOLS_TOKENS_FILE` env var (JSON, filesystem-permission protected)
- US stock universal APIs — `stock_us_list` (daily cache), `stock_us_spot` (60s cache), `stock_us_hist` (multi-source)
- `GET /api/public/v1/stock_us_search` — fuzzy search on US stock cache
- Mutating endpoints moved to `/api/private/v1/` requiring auth: cache pause/resume, default_source set, token CRUD

### Changed

- `POST /auth/token` now returns 410 — old credentials deprecated
- Cache management and default_source POST now require Bearer token

## 0.0.95

### Added

- Fund/ETF universal APIs — `fund_list`, `fund_etf_spot`, `fund_etf_hist`
- `GET /api/public/v1/stock_search` & `fund_search` — fuzzy search on cached lists, <10ms
- `GET /api/public/v1/cache_status` — per-cache metadata with refresh intervals
- `POST /api/public/v1/cache/pause` & `resume` — runtime cache control
- Smart caching: market-hours aware (60s trading / 300s off-hours), weekend detection
- Stale-data headers (`X-Cache-Stale`, `X-Cache-Age`) on spot endpoints during market hours
- List pagination (`page`/`page_size`) with `X-Total-Count` header
- Descriptive cache keys (`stock_spot_sina`, `fund_etf_spot`, etc.)
- `stock_info_a_code_name` → `stock_list`, all v1 paths consolidated under `/api/public/v1/`

### Fixed

- Cached list endpoints fast-fail instead of falling back to slow direct calls
- Duplicate stock spot refresh loop removed from cache thread

## 0.0.94

### Added

- Unified A-share spot API (v1) with source switching — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_zh_a_spot`
- In-memory spot cache with background refresh (60s TTL) — responses <10ms after warmup
- Cache fallback — automatically serves from any available source when the requested one is cold
- Warmup gate — returns 503 + `Retry-After` during initial cache population instead of blocking

- Cached A-stock list API — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_info_a_code_name` (daily refresh, <10ms)
- Static cache data refreshes at independent interval (1 day vs 60s for spot)

### Fixed

- Spot cache fallback now checks all sources before attempting slow direct call
- Fallback snapshot recomputed after retry loop to catch late-arriving cache entries
- Stock name whitespace stripped during cache refresh (e.g. "柳    工" → "柳工")

## 0.0.93

### Added

- Docker build script (`docker-build.sh`) and docker-compose file
- Docker deployment guide (`docs/docker-howto.md`) with overseas user config

## 0.0.92

### Added

- Unified A-share history API (v1) with multi-source switching — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_zh_a_hist`
- Proxy support via `AKSHARE_PROXY` environment variable
- Automatic retry on transient network errors (3 attempts, 5-second delay)
- Runtime default data source toggle — `GET/POST /api/v1/default_source`
- Comprehensive API reference documentation (`docs/api-reference.md`)
- V1 API documentation (`docs/v1-api.md`)
- REASONIX.md project knowledge base for AI assistants

### Fixed

- Unhandled AKShare exceptions now return 502 instead of 500
- V1 routes registered before generic catch-all `/api/public/{item_id}` to avoid route mismatch

